cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FontVibe Kaomoji Dataset"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "FontVibe"
    website: "https://fontvibe.ai"
abstract: >-
  82,109 kaomoji (Japanese text emoticons) merged from seven independent source
  families, with semantic labels (emotion / intent / subject) in six languages
  (English, Japanese, Chinese, Spanish, Portuguese, German) on 69,679 of them,
  a four-level tier split by rendering safety outside Japanese contexts, and
  106 original kaomoji designed for concepts that had none.
keywords:
  - kaomoji
  - 顔文字
  - emoticons
  - japanese
  - text-emoticons
  - dataset
  - multilingual
  - unicode
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://fontvibe.ai/tools/kaomoji"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Funovate/fontvibe-kaomoji"
version: "1.0.7"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
